# Root build context (used by the `web` service, whose context is the repo root so
# the frontend can import repo-root docs — RESEARCH.md etc. — at build time).
# Keep this lean: never ship the data archive, deps, or secrets into an image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/venv
**/__pycache__
backend/data
data
*.duckdb
**/.env
**/.env.*
frontend/dist
